---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpch_simple_q4"
---
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_quantity DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=10                                                                                                                                                |
|               |   Projection: avg(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_tax), tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_linenumber, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_quantity                                                                                                   |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_linenumber, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_quantity]], aggr=[[avg(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_tax)]]                                                                             |
|               |       TableScan: tpch.tpch.lineitem projection=[l_linenumber, l_quantity, l_tax]                                                                                                                              |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [l_quantity@2 DESC], fetch=10                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |   ProjectionExec: expr=[avg(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_tax)@2 as avg(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_tax), l_linenumber@0 as l_linenumber, l_quantity@1 as l_quantity]                                                         |
|               |     SortExec: TopK(fetch=10), expr=[l_quantity@1 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                          |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[l_linenumber@0 as l_linenumber, l_quantity@1 as l_quantity], aggr=[avg(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_tax)]                                                            |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([l_linenumber@0, l_quantity@1], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                           |
|               |           AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[l_linenumber@0 as l_linenumber, l_quantity@1 as l_quantity], aggr=[avg(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_tax)]                                                                 |
|               |             BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |               DataSourceExec: file_groups={32 groups: [<redacted>]}, projection=[l_linenumber, l_quantity, l_tax], file_type=parquet, predicate=true AND DynamicFilter [ empty ], dynamic_rg_pruning=eligible |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
